Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.61,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Truly, who'd have imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:08.76,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,that famously obstinate Norman would\Ntake an orphan as an apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:10.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:14.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,He used to be so adamant that he \Nwouldn't pass on his skills to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:17.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What is his apprentice's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:25.17,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,His name is Arthur. He's a twelve \Nor thirteen-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:30.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.63,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie... Don't tell me that you think \NAnastasia might still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:38.22,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You think that Norman's apprentice \Nmight be your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.48,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That seems highly unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.31,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:44.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:27.23,Narration Top,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,A few weeks have passed since \Nmy father was issued a summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:28.75,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fs15\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(446,429)\pos(494,319)}Episode 10 "Please Call Off the Betrothal"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.00,Narration Top,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,There hasn't been any response yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:35.50,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,All I can do is devote everything I have \Nto learning aristocratic etiquette...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:41.36,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,and write letters of thanks to pass to the \Nguests who attend the betrothal ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:48.14,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,All so that I can grow the slightest \Nbit more worthy of Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:24.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yesterday, I dispatched a carriage \Nto bring the baron here directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:33.19,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If he still doesn't comply, I may have \Nto resort to slightly rougher measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:38.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,If my father remains in hiding, \Nas his blood relative,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to face any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:44.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please don't say that! Do you \Nthink I would allow such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:50.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But someone has to accept responsibility \Nfor his actions, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:53.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'll go to my dance practice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:16.04,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I have nothing left to teach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:18.05,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,She works so much harder \Nthan most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:18.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:25.32,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Don't you ever let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.31,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Noble lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.43,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,will you favor me with a dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,With pleasure... sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.19,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You really have gotten good at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:57.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I've practiced a lot, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:10.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry. My feet suddenly got tangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:13.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're pushing yourself far too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:15.33,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Rest a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:18.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, I haven't pushed myself at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,By the betrothal ceremony, \NI'll do better than—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:22.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.45,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Shouldn't \Nyou go to your rooms and rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:34.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:40.37,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Ever since we heard about Norman's \Napprentice, you've been acting strangely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.78,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're still thinking about \NAnastasia, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There's something bothering you, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:52.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I saw someone... near the artisans' quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Someone who looked like my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Someone blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:06:00.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All right. Let's meet Norman's apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:00.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:05.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Once you've seen him with your own \Neyes, your feelings should lighten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:09.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:21.92,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I've brought Smith Norman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:34.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Norman, it's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.96,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,It has been indeed, Count Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.88,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Norman... what happened to your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.99,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Three years ago while I was working,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:53.26,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,shards of hot iron sprang \Nloose and pierced my goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:58.28,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,I can still see light and dark and colors, \Nso I am able to live surprisingly normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.81,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What about people's faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.53,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,If it's someone I know \Nwell, then I can get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.27,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,But my apprentice waits \Non all the new customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:09.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, where is your apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why isn't he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.48,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:19.07,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,I told him to come with me,\Nbut he said he wasn't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.18,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We'll send another messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:27.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Norman, Luiphon said that your \Napprentice is a young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,but how do you know he's a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:33.71,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Well, he said so himself. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:37.44,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,You can't mean that you think \NI'm sheltering a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:41.61,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Don't even joke about such a thing!\NI would never let a woman into my workshop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.90,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,And Arthur is still just a fledgling, \Nbut he has both talent and grit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:49.31,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I-I see. I heard that you met \NArthur in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:53.73,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Yes, he was fleeing from being \Nsold off to some nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:56.19,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,so he was wandering the \Ntown with no money at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.95,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,When I said that I was a \Nbutton artisan, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:02.36,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,"Really, old man? Then \Nmake me your apprentice!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,He said that himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:06.31,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:11.54,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,He said, "I'm sick of a life of bein' taken \Nadvantage of by rotten, rich villains!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.06,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Just as I thought. He must be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:18.52,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,A noble's daughter would \Nnever speak that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:23.43,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,His skills in the craft still need work, \Nbut his grasp of clothing is exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.50,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Clothes for women to dress as men, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.76,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,He said he'd been making those \Nsorts of things for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:34.09,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Clothes for women to dress as \Nmen? Th-That's just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:38.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What an unusual hobby. \NWere his parents artisans, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:42.65,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to want \Nto talk about his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:45.38,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,No matter what I ask, he always answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.70,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,"Quit asking, you moron! \NI'm just a raggedy cat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.59,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What an entertaining apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.07,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:59.47,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll bring some of the \Nmen's clothes for women that he made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,They'd likely suit Marie unexpectedly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:10.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:11.81,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.70,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Begin a search of the immediate area at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:26.74,Default,servants,0,0,0,,Yes, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:28.60,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.59,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.55,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.49,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,Lady Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.42,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,My lady, why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:43.64,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Mister Johan! Have you seen our lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.48,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Confound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.87,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why can't I find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:07.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie? Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.73,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are, aren't you? May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:12.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:16.00,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:23.09,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, now that he mentions it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:32.57,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,For some reason... I felt like \Nthis place would protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:36.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please... Please let me join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:40.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It gets cold here. Let's drink some \Nhot tea and calm ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:42.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Hearing Mister Norman made me certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My sister loved to make clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And those lines from \N{\i1}The Tale of the Raggedy Red Cat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:17.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,She is alive, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And now there's no reason for \Nme to be allowed to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.77,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:27.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Even if Anastasia is alive, our feelings \Nfor each other are shared, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:31.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My sister is a kind, \Nbeautiful, wonderful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:36.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I'll \Nnever be a match for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I know that your feelings \Nfor me aren't a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:43.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But... it's only because \Nyou don't know my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:47.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,If you knew her properly, I'm certain \Nyou'd fall in love with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:49.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,More than you could ever love someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.90,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.55,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's you I love! \NI've loved you all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:01.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you saying... you can simply \Ncast aside your feelings for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.74,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Cast them aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:06.46,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I could never cast them aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:10.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I love you just as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:17.78,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The me that you love is the beautiful me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:20.58,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,not the ugly human that I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:26.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I... loathe myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:28.80,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.76,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I thought that I wished my sister \Nwere still alive, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:38.45,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,If my sister were dead, then I'd \Nbe able to stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.54,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I allowed myself to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:45.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,My true feelings are so repulsive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.44,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain they would disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:52.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Now, while you still love me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please call off the betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:03.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will return to the Shaderan household.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:11.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All right. I will grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:35.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'll dedicate my life to reimbursing you for\N my living costs and for ending our betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:38.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.13,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I will drive her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.88,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie... is this really what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:31.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know that you don't mean \Nwhat you say, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:32.48,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:37.13,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, isn't there anything \Nleft that I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:41.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:43.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You've already done more than enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:58.02,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If I can find the courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.41,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If I can grow a little \Nbit stronger as a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,then one day, I promise I will come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:11.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please wait \Nfor me until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:24.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I left without saying goodbye to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Even though they took such good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:30.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,If he'd taken someone as \Nungrateful as me as his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,it would bring misfortune to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:35.51,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This is the right thing to do after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:40.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I never imagined he was so weak and cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:42.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Cowardly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:48.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Instead of choosing a happy future for you, \Nhe chose to stop your tears in the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:51.44,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Because he's afraid of hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:53.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Afraid of hurting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:59.76,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I didn't want to get hurt, \Nso I hurt him instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:02.39,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,and he worked to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:05.06,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain it's because \NI seemed about to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:08.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Is that weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:32.29,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Eyes more beautiful than any star...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:38.23,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,From the first moment I \Nmet you, I've loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.96,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,I love you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.51,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)}I love you from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.71,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,And no matter what happens,\NI will always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:48.56,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,53)}You are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:55.50,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros always told \Nme exactly how he felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:58.06,Default,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,And yet I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,All I've done is run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:05.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The first treasure I've ever found.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:11.58,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I was so afraid of losing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:14.24,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,that I lied and said I didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.15,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I didn't want to get hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:20.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,so I tried to convince myself \Nthat I wasn't worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:25.54,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But... the truth is, I've always wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:29.10,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I've wanted it so badly \Nthat I couldn't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:37.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio, please! The carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:38.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:47.79,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We'll be back very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:51.21,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Up until just now, we've simply been \Ncircling near the castle, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:55.73,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The carriage will rock a bit. Please \Nbe careful not to bite your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:10.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I let it slip away once, but this \Ntime everything will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:24.88,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I won't run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.88,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I won't lie to myself anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:34.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The coward... the one who \Nneeds more courage is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to tell you properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:40.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.24,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And everyone in this castle, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Everything related to you, all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:46.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I don't want to let anyone else have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:50.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please give all of yourself to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Why are you behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:08.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I was chasing after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:32.44,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,Stupid! Marie, you're so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.10,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,You're not going to leave anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.27,Default,Cillie,0,0,0,,You're going to say you're home now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm home, Cillie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:41.83,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.58,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:53.74,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,The ultimate apple pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:57.87,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Just one bite and you'll \Nnever think of leaving again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:03.39,Default Top,Toppo,0,0,0,,What do you think the secret ingredient is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:04.66,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.71,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Please don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.44,0:20:11.56,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Kyros always ran away from \Nfalling in love with anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:14.35,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,but now he's finally met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:18.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I won't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:21.50,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It happened before I even realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:26.07,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Here, in this castle, little by \Nlittle, I built the real thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.26,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,A place where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:52.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That's right. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:57.80,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is he searching for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.81,0:21:10.60,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,He's sort of... cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:14.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:16.62,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:19.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If you'd like, the bath is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.37,0:21:21.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Tunika has prepared everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The hot bath was lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lord Kyros is awake yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:40.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What if he's looking for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.34,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.89,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Where is Marie Shaderan's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:51.04,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:54.99,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,It's so dark it's hard to see.\NHurry up and show me—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:00.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:02.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:05.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I woke up, so I came looking \Nfor you. That was too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.22,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Wh-What'd you think you're \Ndoing, you gargantuan man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.58,0:22:13.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What's this? Quite the \Nspirited little hoodlum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:15.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that. She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:21.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,my older sister, Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.43,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie is family,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:02.00,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,and I'm so glad that she came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.61,0:24:05.50,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Wait. Miss Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:09.13,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Next time, "The Empty Princess Lives."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.17,0:24:12.08,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(484,1)\pos(493,318)}Episode 11 "The Empty Princess Lives"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:11.16,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Be sure to watch.
